      <h1>10 Mistakes Americans Make <span class="msv__shimmer">Moving to Spain</span></h1>
      <p>Moving to Spain is exciting, but US citizens face unique challenges that European expats don't. These 10 critical mistakes can cost you thousands, delay your visa, or create serious legal trouble. Here's how to avoid them.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">9 min read</p>
